{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56828","headline":"九嶷邢仙翁诗 · 不详","name":"九嶷邢仙翁诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"虚皇天诏下仙家，不久星潢借客槎。\n壁上风云三尺剑，牀前龙虎一鑪砂。\n行乘海屿千年鹤，坐折壸宫四序花。\n爲爱《阴符》问元义，更随彩仗入烟霞。\n（《三洞羣仙录》卷十六引《谈选》。\n云邢仙翁自唐僖宗时隐九嶷山，宋时尚在世。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56828.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56828","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}